    "body": "As mentioned on the PR this is the current expected behaviour. Rather than disabling the logs completely I think a better alternative would be to change the env var that is used to configure the logging to something starship specific, for example `STARSHIP_LOG`, this should just be a case of switching over to use [`pretty_env_logger::init_custom_env`](https://docs.rs/pretty_env_logger/0.4.0/pretty_env_logger/fn.init_custom_env.html) in the `main.rs` and updating the docs if you would like to open a PR.",
